{"id":"1028296e1af7c37c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ext-complexity.md","title":"Ext 的 Σ₃ 完全性及相对版本","display":"thm-ext-complexity — Ext 的 Σ₃ 完全性及相对版本","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ext-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-ext-complexity"],"display":"thm-ext-complexity — Ext 的 Σ₃ 完全性及相对版本","chapter":"4","section":"4.3.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 4.3.12（完整上下界）","source_printed_pages":[89,91],"source_pdf_pages":[125,127],"depends_on":["[[20-df-ext]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal]]","[[20-df-rel-arith]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ext-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ext-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ext-complexity — Ext 的 Σ₃ 完全性及相对版本"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 4.3.12（完整上下界）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>91</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>125</span><span>127</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" href=\"?note=42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" title=\"20-df-ext\">20-df-ext</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}^A:=\\{e:\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\Phi_e^A\\subseteq f]\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}^A:=\\{e:\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\Phi_e^A\\subseteq f]\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" href=\"?note=42a23ade1ce9e8e9\" title=\"20-df-ext\">20-df-ext</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9aaf109dea18156\" href=\"?note=d9aaf109dea18156\" title=\"20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal\">20-lem-marker-extension-diagonal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8251b2f9fd838667\" href=\"?note=8251b2f9fd838667\" title=\"20-df-rel-arith\">20-df-rel-arith</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ext-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Ext},\\Sigma_3^0),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ext}^A\\in\\Sigma_3^A\\land\\forall S\\in\\Sigma_3^A\\ [S\\le_m\\mathrm{Ext}^A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ext-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Ext},\\Sigma_3^0),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ext}^A\\in\\Sigma_3^A\\land\\forall S\\in\\Sigma_3^A\\ [S\\le_m\\mathrm{Ext}^A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上界：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(e\\in\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,s\">\\(x,s\\)</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{j,t}(x)\">\\(\\varphi_{j,t}(x)\\)</span> 停止，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{e,s}(x)\">\\(\\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\)</span> 已停止时取相同值。该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists j\\forall x,s\\exists t\">\\(\\exists j\\forall x,s\\exists t\\)</span> 可计算矩阵同时确保全性和延伸。困难性由移动标记二分引理给出的单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>：肯定分支定义域余有限而有全延伸；否定分支为每个全程序留下反例。相对构造逐项用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的有界计算，得到同一量词式和相对困难性；固定 oracle 公式的输入参数由相对 s-m-n 编入程序索引，映射本身可普通全可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 4.3.12（完整上下界）；印刷页 89, 91；PDF 第 125, 127 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ext","status":"resolved","id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnch